subject_definitions:
@Image1 is the man in the champagne leather trench coat. Reference role: identity anchor. Keep exactly: silver cropped hair, the oversized double-breasted trench, black trousers, black leather boots, the same face.
@Image2 is the amber cut-glass vessel with the brushed brass lid. Reference role: product hero. Keep exactly: the faceted cut pattern, the amber glass, the brass lid.
@Image3 is the brutalist concrete atrium. Reference role: location. Keep exactly: the strict one-point perspective, the single light shaft from the high slot window, the terrazzo floor.

shot:
One continuous take with no cuts. @Image1 walks toward camera along the centre line of @Image3, holding @Image2 at chest height so the brass lid catches the light shaft. The camera tracks backwards at his walking pace and keeps him centred; dust motes drift through the beam. Late-afternoon contrast, restrained colour, no text.
